<title>USA: TAL lays off staff in Calif., Alaska.</title>
<headline>TAL lays off staff in Calif., Alaska.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>TAL Wireless Networks Inc laid off its U.S. staff in Sunnyvale and Alaska on July 23 due to a continuing shortage of available cash.</p>
<p>John Vargo, chief executive officer, resigned his position with the company on that date as well.</p>
<p>The directors of Tetherless Access Asia Ltd, an Australian operating subsidiary, appointed an administrator to manage the affairs of that company.</p>
<p>The company is currently preparing to file a petition under the U.S. Bankruptcy Reform Act of 1978.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
</text>
